#: scenario2:scenario2_2969C666_724A_4A50_88D6_FC4F569A6141
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: baec5066d0bc3d656550ff4436c9c7392a504d3fb34e05397d15ffbfda826a5c
#. default-sha256: d45908626b1d848b60437cd350e6c2edd3a2a8243eda9c01c9ad169e95897fcf
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2969C666_724A_4A50_88D6_FC4F569A6141"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫The mansion sat near "
"the ocean."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫La villa si trovava "
"vicino all’oceano."

#: scenario2:scenario2_25E93473_3C7F_47AF_B45C_9D323A6F3D5A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d3b52a0579b39845a7134600f24a6abe6d073d8773c66bd74cb3990649fc1d1c
#. default-sha256: 556756e7cf093e9eb2ffee1883ab24652b3e8f08a678c257b47dbfb92b108a39
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_25E93473_3C7F_47AF_B45C_9D323A6F3D5A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫To say it was perched upon a cliff might make it sound rather intimidating..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Dire che fosse arroccata su una scogliera potrebbe farlo sembrare piuttosto "
"minaccioso..."

#: scenario2:scenario2_685FCB43_1481_45D7_BBBE_8FB9C1AC2175
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 44290f4e6ed519bb2c45ae3cb15a25d7dc4e8d7f85ee2862175ae647f12e3945
#. default-sha256: 81983ab2e7285a56c80af86c8bf6e49b1c81e251e786a8b976ead1e4b86cdbad
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_685FCB43_1481_45D7_BBBE_8FB9C1AC2175"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but you could see the beautifully clear sea through the windows—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a glittering "
"expanse of emerald and turquoise."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ma attraverso le finestre si poteva scorgere il meraviglioso mare limpido—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫una "
"distesa scintillante di smeraldo e turchese."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A319AAD1_7EC5_4829_AA77_42149F2755E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 15a059205cd45f91b11c5423a657fb48e8bb557346e382b0df2eff966303a7ae
#. default-sha256: 89a860d88fbf1f68911add0ac65569b47f7b2f154b18288ac1a98a7e7d853c5c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A319AAD1_7EC5_4829_AA77_42149F2755E7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫If the mansion had been in proper condition, it would have been breathtaking against "
"that backdrop."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Se la villa fosse stata in condizioni adeguate, vederla su quello sfondo sarebbe stato "
"uno spettacolo mozzafiato."

#: scenario2:scenario2_0159B64C_5EDC_4035_9E3A_A504D7D567BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 122e9c6bf1d7155371a747efb918e634f712a1733039c6dd46806e5f10fee862
#. default-sha256: 0dfa2a07e574ab05546856937f5ab81c3778e6fcc3292855b2d980ad60bac59f
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0159B64C_5EDC_4035_9E3A_A504D7D567BF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I even wanted to plant orange trees in the garden."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Volevo perfino piantare degli aranci in giardino."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C0EFF7A2_48B2_4EB6_AF03_BD062798B84A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8a77e12773f8036869f6716f82e16cba72bcb43f243f5e29f3853811e89f0ccd
#. default-sha256: dd1ba00a72f4f01777b57a54fc4d2b374656a955d06ecf9201a1688112e66eb6
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C0EFF7A2_48B2_4EB6_AF03_BD062798B84A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though it was a tumultuous era, the sun still shone bright upon the land, which only served "
"to emphasize the house’s unsightliness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sebbene fosse un’epoca tumultuosa, il sole continuava a splendere⟪k:1⟫sulla terra, il che "
"non faceva altro che mettere in risalto la bruttezza⟪k:2⟫della casa."

#: scenario2:scenario2_F40581AD_5819_4290_BCF0_FDEF7F40476F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 888fd9dbfd1a11d6d01bad5aa8d21ba5cae233bbf3719f6a8c3d88a6ba5cef19
#. default-sha256: 907c58bb342294093ec18efae9dc8a13d7f51920a1cecd3b82ede382c448212c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_F40581AD_5819_4290_BCF0_FDEF7F40476F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oh yes, perhaps I should give you some more background information. ⟪k:1⟫At that period in "
"time, a war had just drawn to a close."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ah, giusto, forse dovrei darle qualche altra informazione sul contesto. ⟪k:1⟫In quel periodo "
"storico, si era appena conclusa una guerra."

#: scenario2:scenario2_B6FE0EFE_F238_4376_A78D_6B7BADCD9866
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 364114559181f1cf502457378044b97274ba8dd9f3ceddd5e61cd8b20e3bfd89
#. default-sha256: 640c3d27c01147bf33d311e4a8e6978e8976a1b50320de5311955dd92b3c6d1b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B6FE0EFE_F238_4376_A78D_6B7BADCD9866"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The once gorgeous wetlands were infested with crows picking at decaying "
"remains. Bodies of soldiers fallen in battle continually washed up on the shores of coastal "
"villages."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Quelli che un tempo erano dei graziosissimi stagni erano stati invasi "
"dai corvi che raccoglievano i resti dei cadaveri in decomposizione. Corpi di soldati caduti in "
"battaglia si riversavano costantemente sulle rive dei villaggi costieri."

#: scenario2:scenario2_7B0AC144_0BB9_4AFB_97DD_31740DBF1CB0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f21c73f2bbfa98dcccdd219676f51e7c07f0bc2de518ae38740552fd3935a50
#. default-sha256: 8ae827c8a7d01bf1bd1872999a2acefc02a96795061add09f21025de46e8f682
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7B0AC144_0BB9_4AFB_97DD_31740DBF1CB0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The people wanted nothing more than for the curtain to draw on that deeply political contest."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫La popolazione voleva soltanto che il sipario calasse su quella competizione politica."

#: scenario2:scenario2_B8D6AF17_A0A1_476A_9A57_430A2AB83B0A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3ed914ca898de66cad63e968459571dd1a485db900747b069711ca4021516776
#. default-sha256: a8bca37672a74f35a4a70f4e3e68e630567e6dea1df95ec6533d86434e637a33
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B8D6AF17_A0A1_476A_9A57_430A2AB83B0A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And when it finally did, the kingdom, with its richly fertile shores, was stripped of its "
"independence, beginning a new era under new rule."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E quando finalmente avvenne, il regno, con le sue ricche sponde fertili, fu privato della "
"propria indipendenza, dando inizio al dominio di un nuovo governo."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A9FF47C2_8D32_4008_AB0B_61249DC285D0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9cd6332570bbe2f94ac6dd42377c44a67a753ae6d2b46cfc3e285749fe1b13de
#. default-sha256: e828469df6aed8b55fbaabbf2db5cf354f30b93369cfe8b2fcbe6d7026ddf8ae
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A9FF47C2_8D32_4008_AB0B_61249DC285D0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The people were exhausted, their spirits wasted away."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Le persone erano stremate, i loro spiriti consumati."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C7EED3DA_F03C_489C_9F20_EE195A4DDC86
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 36a5e596e651e45595acc8f3deb89b8a0d3cd33a7cfa9fa6100935e0ea44afa9
#. default-sha256: f62f71481f0a23b4a98515666100564ead3935762d0a88ce183198118d155fc9
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C7EED3DA_F03C_489C_9F20_EE195A4DDC86"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And the splendor of the ocean and sky did nothing to help."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E lo splendore dell’oceano e del cielo non portava alcun aiuto."

#: scenario2:scenario2_765E8C91_48F4_49B8_8547_EF0E80F51144
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d04c64eeff4352dc1b4fafd3d2920199543471f78765d757517e571d10d79579
#. default-sha256: 16eb66e97b95cc9a80a11613bb67d00177a922823c72b1733df46e01e1b9f349
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_765E8C91_48F4_49B8_8547_EF0E80F51144"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In my mind, the beast was emblematic of the times—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫emaciated and enveloped in the "
"scent of blood."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ai miei occhi, la bestia pareva l’emblema di quei tempi—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫emaciata e avvolta "
"dall’odore del sangue."

#: scenario2:scenario2_B395005F_CE73_4906_BCB7_C1626238D28A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8807117777c3c35ff5ff7c87dcbf47d2946f06ec5161701f8b9e28168da4f772
#. default-sha256: 50ec562855a8f7a921b9437778153499921babedadc7b57ccd1dd15b8549e56f
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B395005F_CE73_4906_BCB7_C1626238D28A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But the war came to an end. ⟪k:1⟫Thus the beast did not have to remain a beast, I thought."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma la guerra era finita.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Pertanto la bestia non doveva più rimanere tale, pensai."

#: scenario2:scenario2_B3B52B41_BC9E_441C_A36F_517C882497EB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8cc171ef0eff23b77a9a6aca86176bc1869e02fa72b65d641a3f5276ff91efee
#. default-sha256: 402db5d69c1dc8ffe2282f57d68b7cb3aabcc827136733845637d970e08df0f7
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B3B52B41_BC9E_441C_A36F_517C882497EB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And so, I endeavored to make the beast more human-like."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫E così, tentai di renderlo più umano."

#: scenario2:scenario2_36A1DD21_9EA4_4212_8CD9_A97D7F84D621
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: acbb5422cde8ff1393473499f73d4f3fc1842f45bc89481bdc6cb94d08e213f5
#. default-sha256: b1c2548b7c607dc3d877aa02777d7f1b0ac16864c78fd11357767a392016b423
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_36A1DD21_9EA4_4212_8CD9_A97D7F84D621"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫First, I needed to do something about his appearance."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Prima di tutto, dovevo fare qualcosa per il suo aspetto."

#: scenario2:scenario2_FE16B9C9_16C1_4888_9F02_485BEF2C7FF1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb35fab0d8686eef0a9bf0f31932667e9e47ec94e51026d158030f64c17b6c3e
#. default-sha256: 82ec2ef4353ba29fecd3b0216b7fd46fa3df0b3ce9bfe5a5131ea8cf3e798567
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_FE16B9C9_16C1_4888_9F02_485BEF2C7FF1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I would draw a bath, scrub away all the filth, and dress him in clothing left in the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Avrei voluto fargli un bagno, spazzargli via tutto lo sporco,⟪k:1⟫e vestirlo con gli abiti "
"rimasti nella villa."

#: scenario2:scenario2_48B55AE9_720E_4D2B_ACE8_AE4BB780A80C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a30b8415a54bcab3952bb678dd1a8c7964959a44b3b6def6abde9fc74fe5cc77
#. default-sha256: cb4624beff5b8a8abdaf016912e7d47cb14264f289f740efa06db5390cd83fb3
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_48B55AE9_720E_4D2B_ACE8_AE4BB780A80C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, having sat unused for fifty years, the majority of garments had been devoured by "
"insects and were of little use."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tuttavia, essendo rimasti inutilizzati per cinquant’anni, gran parte degli indumenti erano "
"stati divorati dagli insetti e non avevano più alcuna utilità."

#: scenario2:scenario2_D98AAD6D_E96B_4693_A747_C4715DFAB52D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c35b2c6819e0369fc619dbc7e06edfd9aa4200dcb14c80b0a11790399314835f
#. default-sha256: c1fdf3824a35e146fcbf7e00cc6e42ce2c9c6fb3fe7c01092deec78dccd89c78
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D98AAD6D_E96B_4693_A747_C4715DFAB52D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So I searched the mansion top to bottom for anything the beast could wear, heated up some "
"coals, and set to work ironing what I found."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Così perlustrai la villa da cima a fondo alla ricerca di qualsiasi cosa che potesse vestire "
"la bestia, riscaldai del carbone e stirai tutto quello che riuscii a trovare."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A38703AC_3901_46C2_8B90_D4A6D91C8C6F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4d18234b1244a35804185fb689a159e0d55c22c664661fda8776136d7315ec33
#. default-sha256: 539e552aff46d53e9696d2e748b33173c4063d85e67da6a761aceb8d3400389d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A38703AC_3901_46C2_8B90_D4A6D91C8C6F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫At the time, steam irons had not yet been invented. We used plates of iron heated with coals."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A quel tempo, i ferri da stiro non erano ancora stati inventati. Usavamo lastre di ferro "
"riscaldate col carbone."

#: scenario2:scenario2_D14A52B0_E3D7_45DA_AC8E_0606CC01932A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd76d8266b5c72559817e39aeb76bf0e7a9854a6d332ff10ae6c1890568d024a
#. default-sha256: 632a305d82c6f0be118d0f01f83226b6f76a086f7b02d4c0ae5ad4ea26a5ec9a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D14A52B0_E3D7_45DA_AC8E_0606CC01932A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They somewhat resembled kettles."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Somigliavano vagamente a dei bollitori."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C7E77E07_8625_4BD3_B4B1_D25477A405FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: db8e91edbc6247edb72c60cc794c468799440bd605481f22541b10be67c68364
#. default-sha256: 7e3ecf39443c6ee358839050618e233855faa800d9a49e01e9011d48ed078614
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C7E77E07_8625_4BD3_B4B1_D25477A405FE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I even prepared meals for the beast, in order to teach him proper table "
"manners."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Preparavo alla bestia perfino i pasti, al fine di insegnargli le buone "
"maniere a tavola."

#: scenario2:scenario2_07E03522_87A9_419B_9706_B7016EF22D0F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f71a29af5f2b1be497e8f85e7f41d56bf03d0b26e02f1c3fb6772dcffa3faceb
#. default-sha256: eecc0914c0015dd4d332c89b435c47793e3519f949bdb60d73f9da9cb21ab9df
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_07E03522_87A9_419B_9706_B7016EF22D0F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Although, with the mansion in a nearly uninhabitable state of disarray, there was only so "
"much I could do in the kitchen."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ciò nonostante, con la villa in uno stato di disordine quasi inabitabile, c’era ben poco che "
"potessi fare in cucina."

#: scenario2:scenario2_44DCF1A1_DCDB_4D0D_85B8_19709B8DCE59
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c46daa0f5875dd6e96e967903a22050fc2403c57704edfc0e4d8c8a5a94d9725
#. default-sha256: 392d5976943679ba5450ff56d7a1bb16a3a5ac8b9def666bd0e69424c736995d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_44DCF1A1_DCDB_4D0D_85B8_19709B8DCE59"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And the only supplies I had to work with were what was left in the cellar."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E le uniche provviste a cui potevo attingere erano quelle rimaste in cantina."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A48236E7_2B15_4071_9C06_0EBE6C14F04B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 75f2ee8e3ddfe8d31d6df635609c3a2cc0aad65f388452b28f02f540fa470087
#. default-sha256: 05545a83a1b74405c58ff7e56a8c8099ba3076247977ad889f42a8434cba02c5
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A48236E7_2B15_4071_9C06_0EBE6C14F04B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As such, I was not able to put to use the cooking skills I had learned in the flaxen-haired "
"family’s time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pertanto, non fui in grado di sfruttare le abilità culinarie apprese durante l’epoca della "
"famiglia dai capelli dorati."

#: scenario2:scenario2_DDA935CC_8CFF_4500_B1F0_65752F2C3766
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c4c4702ca8dc355f0e4091f48205d5e446f13a040851c23b00d5f2d4ccc80153
#. default-sha256: f1a90c5c8f73a363a6be7bcf0ce09f6fe813ce5349df125582ed35a4e9d001f7
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_DDA935CC_8CFF_4500_B1F0_65752F2C3766"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Now, now. ⟪k:5⟫You mustn’t eat with your hands.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Do you want to "
"get your fingers and face dirty?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Su, su. ⟪k:5⟫Non devi mangiare con le mani.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Non vorrai mica "
"sporcarti le dita e imbrattarti il muso?"

